## Deploy
Relay-critical for server half; client half is local install (`just bi` / install-all). Prefer shipping client Retry-After respect with or before tight server limits so dogfood hosts don't spin.

Depends on B276 (path meter) + B277 (connection caps). Finding: .collab/findings/2026-07-23T08-05-00Z-b270-ws-subscribe-dos-after-502.md